# Course title
Ship the Right Thing Faster with SDD: Product Development in the AI Era

SDD - AI 时代产品开发新方法：更快交付正确的产品

## Target audience

- Business transformation leaders
- Digital transformation leads
- Product owners and product managers
- Business analysts and subject matter experts


- 业务转型负责人
