- Design an SDD workspace to organize specifications and product development assets.
- Develop a simple application with skills to meet defined acceptance criteria.
- Organize project knowledge with skills and rules to support consistent reuse.
- Evaluate workflow approaches to recommend one that fits the team's needs.


